			"notes": "The first version of **LoverMods**! LoverMods is a **all-in-one** mod for **LoverCraft** with features for netherwart farming for money and skin trading! There will be more features **soon...**\n\n- **FarmerAddons** has been **ported** into **LoverMods**!\n- Skin Value Checker (**hover** over any skin in skindex or in a players inventory for info on the skin!) **ONLY UP TO SEASON 3 + 4 JOIN THE [DISCORD](https://discord.gg/MJ8wmEa3b4) TO HELP**\n- /RefreshSkins to **update the skin list** or wait an hour for auto updates\n- Update Notifier in game (when a new version drops you can choose to download the update)\n- Message of the days :)\n\nI plan on adding more so if you have suggestions join our [Discord](https://discord.gg/MJ8wmEa3b4)!"
